BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

REGENT OF TANAH BUMBU,

Considering:
a. that Women and Children have the right to obtain protection from torture, threats, pressure, and have the right to obtain equal treatment and opportunities to obtain justice and welfare in accordance with the mandate of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
b. that Women's Empowerment and protecting the rights of Children is an obligation of the Regional Government and the Community in the Region;
